{# MENUS, schedule variant (theme.components.menus = 'menus_schedule'; needs
   theme.style.seam set and client.serviceRows filled).

   For a kitchen with one list and a schedule — lunch, dinner, a happy hour —
   rather than three menus. Three equal cards there would be an invention
   dressed as information; this sets the schedule as typography: rows on
   hairlines, the one that matters lit in the accent, and the photograph
   bleeding off the left edge to carry the weight the cards used to.

   The photograph is a 51.3% column from lg, its right edge cut with the
   concave seam so the copy beside it gets the wide side of the bow. That
   width is not arbitrary: it is where about_seam's panel edge leaves off
   (.885 x 58%), so the two seams meet at the section break. The copy
   column's right padding is the site wrapper's own text edge.

   THE ROWS READ AS TWO COLUMNS FROM xl, NOT lg. At 1024-1279 the copy column
   is ~370px and a 9.5rem label cell squeezes the description to 243px.
   Stacked below xl: name left, hours right on one baseline, description
   under both.

   ONE LEFT EDGE. Heading, rows and buttons all start on the column's own
   padding edge. Pulling the rows leftward on their own to sit in the bow
   read as three left edges on the build that tried it.

   The panel is bound by HEIGHT and srcset only knows width, so it asks for
   100vw and takes the largest frame rather than a 1200px file it would then
   upscale after the cover crop. #}
<section id="menus" class="ground-ink relative overflow-hidden bg-secondary-700">
  <div class="relative lg:grid lg:min-h-[44rem] lg:grid-cols-[51.3%_minmax(0,1fr)]">

    <div class="relative lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-1">
      <img
        src="{{ client.menus.image }}"
        alt="{{ client.menus.imageAlt or '' }}"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        sizes="100vw"
        class="h-72 w-full object-cover [clip-path:url(#seam-h)] sm:h-96 lg:h-full lg:min-h-[44rem] lg:[clip-path:url(#seam-v-in)]"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="px-6 py-20 sm:py-24 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-start-1 lg:py-28 lg:pl-10 lg:pr-[calc(max((100vw-80rem)/2,0px)+2rem)] xl:pl-12">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-xl text-center lg:mx-0 lg:text-left" data-reveal="up">
        {% if client.menus.eyebrow %}<p class="eyebrow">{{ client.menus.eyebrow }}</p>{% endif %}
        <h2 class="section-title !mt-0 text-white lg:after:mx-0">{{ client.menus.title or "Our Menus" }}</h2>
        {% if client.menus.subtitle %}
        <p class="mt-5 text-pretty text-lg/8 text-gray-300">{{ client.menus.subtitle }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <dl class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-xl lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-2xl" data-reveal="up" data-reveal-delay="1">
        {% for row in client.serviceRows %}
        <div class="border-t border-white/15 py-6 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 xl:grid xl:grid-cols-[9.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] xl:gap-x-8 xl:py-7" data-reveal="up" data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index }}">
          <dt class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1 xl:flex-col xl:items-start xl:justify-start xl:gap-y-1.5">
            <span class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold {% if row.note %}text-accent-500{% else %}text-white{% endif %}">{{ row.title }}</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide {% if row.note %}text-accent-400{% else %}text-gray-300{% endif %}">{{ row.when }}</span>
          </dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-pretty text-lg/8 text-gray-300 xl:mt-0">{{ row.body }}</dd>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </dl>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-stretch gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-center lg:justify-start" data-reveal="up" data-reveal-delay="2">
        <a href="{{ client.urls.menus }}" class="btn-accent rounded-btn border border-transparent px-7 py-3.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] whitespace-nowrap">{{ client.menus.ctaLabel or "See the Full Menu" }}</a>
        {%- if client.id %}
        <a href="{{ client.urls.order }}" class="rounded-btn border border-white/35 px-7 py-3.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white whitespace-nowrap transition-colors hover:border-accent-500 hover:text-accent-500">{{ client.menus.orderLabel or "Order Online" }}</a>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
